<!-- Page Contact area start here -->
<section class="project-details pt-120 pb-70">
	<div class="auto-container Affiliate">
		Cookie Policy – MNB Soft Solution

		Effective Date: [Insert Date]

		At MNB Soft Solution, we value your privacy and transparency. This Cookie Policy explains how and why we use cookies and similar technologies on our websites, applications, and digital platforms. We believe in giving our users clarity, choice, and control over their browsing experience.

		By using our website and IT products, you agree to the use of cookies in accordance with this Cookie Policy. If you do not agree, you can adjust your browser settings or disable cookies. However, please note that certain features of our services may not function properly without cookies.

		<h2 class="title">
			1. What Are Cookies?
		</h2>

		Cookies are small text files stored on your computer, smartphone, or device when you visit a website. They help websites recognize your device, remember your preferences, and improve your overall experience.

		Cookies do not typically contain personal data that directly identifies you, but information collected through them may be linked to personal data we hold.

			<h2 class="title">
				2. Why Do We Use Cookies?
			</h2>

		We use cookies to ensure that our website and IT products deliver a smooth, secure, and personalized experience. The purposes include:

		Improving Website Performance – Ensuring fast load times and reducing technical issues.

		Enhancing Security – Detecting fraudulent activity, protecting user accounts, and safeguarding sensitive data.

		Personalizing Content – Showing you relevant features, suggestions, and services.

		Analytics & Research – Understanding how visitors use our website so we can make improvements.

		Advertising & Marketing – Delivering targeted ads and measuring their effectiveness.

				<h2 class="title">
					3. Types of Cookies We Use
				</h2>

		We categorize our cookies into several groups for better understanding:

		a. Strictly Necessary Cookies

		Essential for the functioning of our website and IT products.

		Enable core services like login, session management, and security.

		Without them, you cannot access critical features.

		b. Performance Cookies

		Collect anonymous data on how visitors interact with our website.

		Help us identify bottlenecks, broken links, or areas needing optimization.

		Example: Google Analytics cookies.

		c. Functional Cookies

		Remember your preferences, language settings, and customizations.

		Provide a more personalized user experience.

		d. Targeting & Advertising Cookies

		Track browsing behavior to show you relevant advertisements.

		Used by us and trusted third-party partners.

		Help us deliver offers tailored to your interests.

		e. Third-Party Cookies

		Set by external services we use, such as analytics, chatbots, or social media integrations.

		For example, cookies placed by YouTube for embedded videos or by LinkedIn for campaign tracking.

					<h2 class="title">
						4. Cookies and Personal Data
					</h2>

		Some cookies may collect limited personal information like your IP address, device type, or location. At MNB Soft, we handle such data with the same high standards applied to all personal data processing, ensuring compliance with GDPR, CCPA, and other applicable privacy laws.

		We do not sell or misuse cookie-related information.

						<h2 class="title">
							5. Managing & Controlling Cookies
						</h2>

		You are in control of how cookies are used. You can:

		Accept or Reject Cookies: Through our cookie consent banner when you first visit our website.

		Browser Settings: Adjust settings to block, delete, or allow cookies.

		Opt-Out of Advertising Cookies: Use third-party tools such as the Network Advertising Initiative Opt-Out

							<h2 class="title">
								8. Security of Cookies
							</h2>

		At MNB Soft Solution, we ensure that cookies used on our platforms are:

		Securely Encrypted where possible.

		Scoped to reduce misuse by limiting access.

		Periodically Reviewed to remove outdated or unnecessary cookies.

		We implement strict access controls to prevent unauthorized cookie tampering.

								<h2 class="title">
									9. International Users
								</h2>

		If you access our website from outside India, please note that cookies may be processed in accordance with local and international privacy standards. We ensure that all processing complies with applicable cross-border data transfer rules.

									<h2 class="title">
										10. Updates to This Cookie Policy
									</h2>

		We may update this Cookie Policy from time to time to reflect:

		Changes in technology or legal requirements.

		Updates to our IT products and services.

		Feedback from users or regulators.

		The last updated date will always be displayed at the top of this page. We encourage you to review this page periodically to stay informed.

										<h2 class="title">
											11. Your Rights
										</h2>

		Depending on your location, you may have rights under data protection laws related to cookies and personal data, including:

		The right to access your data.

		The right to request correction or deletion.

		The right to withdraw consent for cookie use.

		The right to file a complaint with a supervisory authority.

		To exercise these rights, please contact us using the details below.

											<h2 class="title">
												12. Contact Us
											</h2>

		If you have questions or concerns about this Cookie Policy, please reach out:

		📧 Email: privacy@mnbsoft.com
	</div>
